            "an energy efficiency grade label; 3) Products must also meet "


            "minimum colour rendering index (≥ 70) and lumen maintenance "


            "requirements; 4) Energy efficiency grades are classified as "


            "Grade 1 (highest), Grade 2 and Grade 3, with Grade 3 as the "


            "minimum market access requirement."


