            "32nd Session of the Standing Committee of the 13th National "


            "People's Congress, effective from 1 June 2022. The Law elevated "


            "the administrative institutional framework established by the "


            "2016 Wetland Protection and Restoration System Plan to a legal "


            "framework, defined the definition and scope of wetlands at the "


