            "The Ministry of Industry and Information Technology organises  "

            "guidance interpretation and training promotion for the Guide;  "

            "guides local MIIT authorities to organise application and  "

            "publicity exchange activities in light of local conditions;  "

            "encourages industry associations and technical service  "

            "organisations to provide technical support and exchange platforms."

